(CATEGORIES OF NARRATION \(Khabar\):) '
(1. Mutawatir: Mass-transmitted narration by numerous reliable chains.) '
(2. Ahad: Singular or limited transmission chains.) '
(   - Sahih \(Authentic\): Continuous chain, upright narrators, no defects.) '
(   - Hasan \(Good\): Slight deficiency in precision, but acceptable.) '
(   - Da'if \(Weak\): Missing condition of authenticity.) '
